{"id":"steam-1349760","steam":1349760,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Essential Mayhem","summary":"A casual, cartoony, money-management game set during a terrifying pandemic.\r\nRace to restock shelves before customers leave unfulfilled; all while avoiding sick people along the way.","about":"Welcome to your new government-mandated life as an essential worker! In this role you will enjoy such benefits as: restocking food, restocking drinks, and the exercise gained by avoiding a crippling virus!\r\n\r\nIn this game you will manage your food, family, and gas, all while the threat of paying rent looms over your head. After your long work day, you will make choices that will help (or hinder) you the next day. Do not let your health, or the health of your family, fall by the wayside.\r\n\r\nWe cannot wait to work with you!\r\n\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\n-Alternative Controls allowing the game to be played with just a mouse\r\n\r\n-2D pixel art graphics and videos\r\n\r\n-Never ending work with little to no compensation \r\n\r\n-Easy to follow objective and tight gameplay loop\r\n\r\n-Character progression","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349760/library_600x900.jpg?t=1595878206","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349760/header.jpg?t=1595878206","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349760/library_hero.jpg?t=1595878206","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349760/header.jpg?t=1595878206","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349760/ss_9f3cb2d83ed30dd8da50574c58ec31efac4405d0.600x338.jpg?t=1595878206","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349760/ss_9f3cb2d83ed30dd8da50574c58ec31efac4405d0.jpg?t=1595878206"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1349760/s